msgid "@niko I can't combine those..."
msgstr "@niko 組み合わせられない…"

msgid "@ed [Those can't be combined.]"
msgstr "@ed [この2つを組み合わせることはできません]"

msgid "@ed Niko dips the branch into the alcohol."
msgstr "@ed ニコは枝をアルコールにつけた。"

msgid "@niko Use the screwdriver to... pull the lens out...?"
msgstr "@niko ドライバーを使って…レンズを外せばいいの…？"

msgid "@niko Okay..."
msgstr "@niko 分かった…"

msgid "@niko_speak Done!"
msgstr "@niko_speak できた！"

msgid "@niko The lens pops right in."
msgstr "@niko レンズがぴったりはまった。"

msgid "@niko I can't use this one, \\p...\\>\\n\\@niko_speak My eyes are closed in it!"
msgstr "@niko これは使えないよ、 \\p…\\>\\n\\@niko_speak 目を閉じちゃってるもん！"

msgid "@niko I don't think we can do anything else here, \\p..."
msgstr "@niko もう何もできることなさそうだよ、 \\p…"

msgid "@niko It feels like we're on the right track, though!"
msgstr "@niko ちゃんと先に進めてる気はするけどね！"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I'm not gonna smash the bottle!"
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed ビンは割らないよ！"

msgid "@niko_huh \\p!!!\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed I am NOT gonna smash the sun!"
msgstr "@niko_huh \\p！！！\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed 太陽は絶対にダメ！"

msgid "@niko We're... using the sun directly on the battery?"
msgstr "@niko 太陽の光を…直接バッテリーに？"

msgid "@niko I would've never thought of that!"
msgstr "@niko 全然思いつかなかった！"

msgid "@niko_speak Good thinking, \\p!"
msgstr "@niko_speak ナイスアイデア、 \\p！"

msgid "@niko_speak Ah, looks like it's already fully charged."
msgstr "@niko_speak あっ、充電し終わったみたい。"

msgid "@niko That was fast..."
msgstr "@niko 一瞬だったね…"

msgid "@niko I should inject the liquid through the cork, right, \\p?"
msgstr "@niko 液体を注入したらいいんだよね、 \\p？"

msgid "@niko_speak It's like I'm a doctor!"
msgstr "@niko_speak お医者さんになったみたい！"

msgid "@niko So... I should inject the liquid through the cork, right, \\p?"
msgstr ""
"@niko じゃあ…\n"
"液体を注入したらいいんだよね、 \\p？"

msgid "@niko_speak Oh!\\n\\.\\.\\@niko I should probably shake this too."
msgstr "@niko_speak あっ！\\n\\.\\.\\@niko あと、振ったほうがいいよね。"

msgid "@niko_speak ...It changed color!"
msgstr "@niko_speak …色が変わった！"

msgid "@niko I'm guessing you want me to pour this acid onto the sponge, \\p?"
msgstr ""
"@niko これをスポンジにかければ\n"
"いいんだよね、 \\p？"

msgid "@niko_speak Good thing I have these gloves!"
msgstr "@niko_speak 手袋があってよかった！"

msgid "@niko_speak I hope this works..."
msgstr "@niko_speak うまくいくといいけど…"

msgid "@niko_speak \\.\\.\\...wait!\\.\\. \\@niko Shouldn't I be wearing gloves for this?"
msgstr "@niko_speak \\.\\.\\.待って！ \\.\\. \\@niko 手袋をしたほうがいいよね？"

msgid "@niko_speak Safety first!"
msgstr "@niko_speak 安全第一！"

msgid "@niko_speak Oh yeah! We can use the feather as a pen!"
msgstr "@niko_speak そうだ！羽根をペンとして使おう！"

msgid "@niko I saw it in a picture book once."
msgstr "@niko 昔、絵本で見たことあるんだ。"

msgid "@niko_speak Oh! Maybe we can make a button out of this!"
msgstr "@niko_speak あっ！これでボタンが作れるかも！"

msgid "@niko I can cut out a piece of the can and fold it into a rectangle shape..."
msgstr ""
"@niko 缶を切り抜いて、\n"
"長方形に折りたたんで…"

msgid "@niko Just like arts and crafts!"
msgstr "@niko 工作みたいだね！"

msgid "@niko Hmm... I don't think it's supposed to be this simple."
msgstr "@niko うーん…こんなに単純なわけないよね。"

msgid "@niko_speak How are we gonna connect it to the elevator?"
msgstr ""
"@niko_speak どうやってエレベーターに\n"
"接続したらいいんだろ？"

msgid "@niko_speak Well, let's find out!"
msgstr "@niko_speak とりあえず、やってみよう！"

msgid "@niko The magnets don't stick to the aluminum, but..."
msgstr "@niko 磁石はアルミにくっつかないけど…"

msgid "@niko_speak Oh! What if I just folded the magnets under this edge?"
msgstr "@niko_speak あっ！磁石を中に折り込んだらどうかな？"

msgid "@niko Hmm...\\| It's holding together, if just barely."
msgstr "@niko ええっと…\\|どうにかくっついてる。"

msgid "@niko I... hope that's good enough?"
msgstr "@niko これで…いいかな？"

msgid "@niko The magnets don't stick to aluminum..."
msgstr "@niko 磁石がアルミにくっつかない…"

msgid "@niko The back of the photo is covered in glue."
msgstr "@niko 写真の裏側がノリでベトベト…"

msgid "@niko ...and glitter."
msgstr "@niko …あと、ラメも。"

msgid "@niko The card has my face on it now."
msgstr "@niko カードにミーの顔写真がついたよ。"

msgid "@niko The card is covered in glue."
msgstr "@niko カードにノリがついたよ。"

msgid "@niko_speak So, put the pill in the water?"
msgstr "@niko_speak 水に入れたらいいの？"

msgid "@niko It dissolved really fast!"
msgstr "@niko すぐに溶けたね！"

msgid "@niko The jar is full of fireflies."
msgstr "@niko ビンはホタルでいっぱいだ。"

msgid "@niko Coals."
msgstr "@niko 石炭だ。"

msgid "@niko It's some kind of stew."
msgstr "@niko 何かのシチューみたい。"

msgid "@niko It's a jar full of fireflies."
msgstr "@niko ホタルでいっぱいのビンだ。"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I can't reach the top, \\p..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 上まで届かないよ、 \\p…"

msgid "@niko It's a gas vent."
msgstr "@niko ガスの通気孔だ。"

msgid "@niko Small sprouts. \\>\\@niko_speak We gotta be careful we don't step on these!"
msgstr "@niko 小さな芽。 \\>\\@niko_speak 踏まないように気をつけないと！"

msgid "@alula You got it!"
msgstr "@alula ラジャー！"

msgid "@niko Small sprouts. \\>\\@niko_speak I gotta be careful I don't step on these!"
msgstr "@niko 小さな芽。 \\>\\@niko_speak 踏まないように気をつけないと！"

msgid "@niko It's a small tree."
msgstr "@niko 小さな木だ。"

msgid "@niko It's off."
msgstr "@niko 電源が切れてる。"

msgid "@niko It's a fridge."
msgstr "@niko 冷蔵庫だ。"

msgid "@niko It's a little plant."
msgstr "@niko 小さな植物だ。"

msgid "@niko It's a trash bin."
msgstr "@niko ゴミ箱だ。"

msgid "@niko A bag full of trash."
msgstr "@niko ゴミでいっぱいの袋だ。"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Gross!"
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed うええ！"

msgid "@niko It's a bed."
msgstr "@niko ベッドだ。"

msgid "@niko ...well, more like a mattress."
msgstr "@niko …どっちかと言うと、マットレスかな。"

msgid "@niko Jars of fireflies are placed next to the fields."
msgstr "@niko ホタルのビンが畑のそばに置かれてる。"

msgid "@niko Just a jar."
msgstr "@niko ただの壺。"

msgid "@niko Some jars."
msgstr "@niko 壺がいくつかある。"

msgid "@niko A streetlamp."
msgstr "@niko 街灯。"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed More of those squares..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 四角形ばっかり…"

msgid "@niko3 Those squares again..."
msgstr "@niko3 また四角形…"

msgid "@niko_huh These squares are just everywhere..."
msgstr "@niko_huh ほんとに四角形だらけ…"

msgid "@niko This looks like an altar..."
msgstr "@niko 祭壇みたいだ…"

msgid "@niko_speak Fish!"
msgstr "@niko_speak お魚！"

msgid "@alula_speak Fish!"
msgstr "@alula_speak お魚ー！"

msgid "@niko_speak It's clothes!"
msgstr "@niko_speak 服だ！"

msgid "@calamus_shame Oh! I should probably take these in soon!"
msgstr "@calamus_shame あっ！そろそろ取り込まなきゃ！"

msgid "@niko It's a big metal box with complicated machinery inside."
msgstr "@niko 大きな鉄の箱だ。中に複雑な機械が入ってる。"

msgid "@niko It's a big metal box with lots of machinery inside. \\.\\.\\@niko_speak This one has a robot in it!"
msgstr "@niko 機械がいっぱい入った、大きな鉄の箱だ。 \\.\\.\\@niko_speak これにはロボットも入ってる！"

msgid "@niko It's a bookshelf."
msgstr "@niko 本棚。"

msgid "@niko It's a shelf full of little machine parts and tools I don't recognize."
msgstr ""
"@niko 小さな機械部品や道具がたくさん並んだ棚。\n"
"どれも見たことないや…"

msgid "@niko It's a gravestone."
msgstr "@niko お墓だ。"

msgid "@niko A robot without power."
msgstr "@niko 動力がないロボット。"

msgid "@calamus ...wait."
msgstr "@calamus …あれ。"

msgid "@calamus_sad ...we can't get back into our house..."
msgstr "@calamus_sad …家に入れないぞ…"

msgid "@niko It's a blanket covered in shiny things."
msgstr "@niko キラキラで覆われた布だ。"

msgid "@magpie_hm Still kinda sad I lost most of my stuff..."
msgstr "@magpie_hm 商品をほとんど失くしちまったのは残念だが…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I don't think it's safe to use this again, \\p."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed これを使うのは危ないよ、 \\p。"

msgid "@ed [You cannot fast travel right now.]"
msgstr "@ed [今はファストトラベルできない。]"

msgid "@tut FAST TRAVEL\\n\\n\\nYOU CAN QUICKLY TRAVEL TO THE LOCATIONS YOU HAVE ALREADY VISITED BY SELECTING THE \"FAST TRAVEL\" OPTION IN THE MENU.\\n\\nYOU CAN OPEN THE MENU WITH @MAINMENU\\n\\nFAST TRAVEL CANNOT BE USED INDOORS."
msgstr "@tut ファストトラベル\\n\\n\\nメニューからファストトラベルを選択すると、今まで訪れたことのある場所へとすぐに移動できる。\\n\\n @メインメニュー でメニューを開くことができる。\\n\\n屋内でファストトラベルは使用できない。"

msgid "@tut2 CONTROLS\\n\\nEXAMINE/SELECT - @OK\\n\\nCANCEL - @CANCEL\\n\\nWALK - @MOVE\\n\\nWALK FASTER - @RUN\\n\\nMENU - @MAINMENU\\n\\nINVENTORY - @INVENTORY"
msgstr "@tut2 操作\\n\\n調べる/選択 - @OK\\n\\nキャンセル - @CANCEL\\n\\n歩く - @MOVE\\n\\n早歩き - @RUN\\n\\nメニュー - @MAINMENU\\n\\nインベントリー - @INVENTORY"

msgid "@tut GAMEPLAY\\n\\nEXPLORE AND INTERACT WITH THE ENVIRONMENT AND CHARACTERS. SOMETIMES YOU MAY FIND AN ITEM.\\n\\nONCE YOU HAVE PICKED UP AN ITEM, YOU MAY SELECT IT FROM YOUR INVENTORY.\\n\\nWHEN THE ITEM IS ACTIVE, YOU CAN EITHER COMBINE IT WITH OTHER ITEMS IN THE INVENTORY OR USE IT AT CERTAIN LOCATIONS IN ORDER TO PROGRESS."
msgstr ""
"@tut ゲームについて\n"
"\n"
"世界を探索して、キャラクターに 話しかけることができる。たまに アイテムを見つけることもある。 拾ったアイテムはインベントリーから 選択できる。アイテムを選択すると、 インベントリー内に他のアイテムと 組み合わせたり、特定の場所で使用して 物語を進めたりすることができる。"

msgid "@tut OTHER\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nCLOSING THE GAME WINDOW WILL SAVE YOUR PROGRESS.\\n\\nTHIS GAME ALSO SAVES AFTER SOME KEY EVENTS."
msgstr "@tut その他\\n\\n\\n\\nゲーム画面を閉じると進行状況が 記録される。\\n\\n重要なイベントの後にも同様に 保存される。"

msgid "@niko_speak \\p, there's something in the air here..."
msgstr ""
"@niko_speak \\p、ここの空気\n"
"何か変…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed It hurts to breathe..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 息をするのがつらいよ…"

msgid "@ed [The air here is unbreathable.]"
msgstr "@ed [ここでは呼吸ができない。]"

msgid "@niko_gasmask I should be fine with this mask on."
msgstr ""
"@niko_gasmask このマスクを着けてれば\n"
"きっと大丈夫だよね。"

msgid "Start over?"
msgstr "やり直す？"

msgid "[\"Yes\", \"No\"]"
msgstr "[\"はい\",\"いいえ\"]"

msgid "@niko It's an empty rectangular slot.\\>\\nLooks like something could fit in here..."
msgstr "@niko 空の長方形のスロットだね。\\>\\n何かはめ込むことができそう…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed \\p... someone lives here...\\>\\nWe can't just sleep in their bed."
msgstr ""
"@niko_eyeclosed \\p…\n"
"ここには住んでる人がいるから…\\>\\n勝手にベッドで寝たらダメだよ。"

msgid "@niko Right, I can refill this tube with more water here."
msgstr ""
"@niko よし、ここでこの管に\n"
"もっと水を補充できる。"

msgid "@niko It's a sink."
msgstr "@niko 流し台だ。"

msgid "Quit and record your progress?"
msgstr "終了して進行状況を記録しますか？"

msgid "This action will record your progress in this world."
msgstr "この行動により、この世界での進行状況が記録されます。"

msgid "To return to this world again, you need to relaunch the application."
msgstr "この世界に戻るには、アプリケーションを再起動する必要があります。"

msgid "Proceed?"
msgstr "よろしいですか？"

msgid "@niko I'll wear them when I have to."
msgstr "@niko 必要になったら着けるね。"

msgid "@niko I can't take this off here, \\p!"
msgstr "@niko ここでは外せないよ、 \\p！"

msgid "@niko I'll wear it when I have to."
msgstr "@niko 必要になったら着けるね。"

msgid "Lamplighter has forgotten the elevator code (starting at 0 0 0 0 0 again)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Lamplighter now knows the elevator code."
msgstr ""

msgid "[\"SAVE?\", \"LOAD\", \"REAL LOAD\", \"NO\"]"
msgstr "[\"セーブしますか？\",\"ロード\",\"REAL LOAD\",\"いいえ\"]"

msgid "@niko Where are we...?"
msgstr "@niko 何、ここ…？"

msgid "@niko Is this... the inside of the Tower?"
msgstr "@niko ここは…塔のなか？"

msgid "@niko It's...\\.\\. \\@niko_eyeclosed a lot darker than I thought..."
msgstr "@niko 何か…\\.\\.\\@niko_eyeclosed 思ってたよりもすごく暗い…"

msgid "@niko ...wait.\\>\\n\\@niko_shock Where's the sun?"
msgstr "@niko …ねえ。\\>\\n\\@niko_shock 太陽はどこ？"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed ...\\p... Do you know what happened to the sun?"
msgstr ""
"@niko_eyeclosed …\\p…\n"
"太陽がどうなってるか分かる？"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed2 ...\\....\\...."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed2 …\\.…\\.…"

msgid "@niko_speak ......\\p?"
msgstr "@niko_speak ……\\p？"

msgid "@niko_shock \\p??"
msgstr "@niko_shock \\p？？"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Come on, \\p...\\. \\@niko_distressed Say something!"
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed ちょっと、 \\p…\\.\\@niko_distressed 何かしゃべってよ！"

msgid "@niko_surprised \\p!!!"
msgstr "@niko_surprised \\p！！！"

msgid "@niko_distressed What's...\\.\\. going on......."
msgstr "@niko_distressed 何が…\\.\\. 起きてるの……"

msgid "@niko \\p? Are you still there?"
msgstr "@niko \\p、 まだそこにいる？"

msgid "[\"Yes\"]"
msgstr "[\"はい\"]"

msgid "@niko_speak Ah.\\> I'm awake."
msgstr "@niko_speak よかった。\\>いま起きたよ。"

msgid "@niko I had a dream just now."
msgstr "@niko いまね、夢を見てた。"

msgid "[\"I saw.\"]"
msgstr "[\"知っているよ。\"]"

msgid "@niko You did?\\>\\n\\@niko_speak Wow!"
msgstr "@niko 本当？\\>\\@niko_speak すごい！"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed ....I...\\| I really thought I was back home..."
msgstr ""
"@niko_eyeclosed …家に…\\|ミーが住んでた家に\n"
"帰ってこれたんだって、\n"
"そう思ったんだ…"

msgid "@niko Oh, the sun back in my home world isn't a lightbulb.\\>\\n\\@niko_speak It's a big ball of fire in the sky!"
msgstr "@niko あ、ミーの世界だと太陽は電球じゃないんだよ。\\>\\n\\@niko_speak 空に浮かぶ、おっきな火の玉なんだ！"

msgid "@niko I don't think I would be able to hold it like I do with the sun from your world..."
msgstr ""
"@niko この世界…神様の世界とは違って、\n"
"手に持つことはできないんだ…"

msgid "[\"This isn't my world.\"]"
msgstr "[\"ここは私の世界ではないぞ。\"]"

msgid "@niko_speak Huh?"
msgstr "@niko_speak え？"

msgid "[\"This isn't the world I live in.\"]"
msgstr "[\"私はこの世界の住人ではないんだ。\"]"

msgid "@niko_speak Really?\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed ...ah, I guess not.\\>\\n\\@niko If you're the god of this world, you wouldn't necessarily be in it."
msgstr ""
"@niko_speak そうなの？\\>\\@niko_eyeclosed …そっか、そうだよね。\\>\\n\\@niko この世界の神様だからって、\n"
"ここに住んでるとは限らないもんね。"

msgid "@niko_speak What's your home world called?"
msgstr "@niko_speak 神様が住んでる世界は、何て呼ばれてるの？"

msgid "[\"Earth.\", \"That's a secret.\"]"
msgstr "[\"地球。\",\"内緒だ。\"]"

msgid "@niko_speak Earth?\\>\\n\\@niko Like, the stuff on the ground?\\>\\n\\@niko_speak ...Wait, do you live underground?"
msgstr "@niko_speak チキュウ？\\>\\n\\@niko チキュウ…地の宮殿って意味？\\>\\n\\@niko_speak …あっ、もしかして地中で暮らしてるの？"

msgid "@niko_speak Wow...\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed I can't imagine what that's like..."
msgstr "@niko_speak わあ…\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed どんな感じか想像もつかないや…"

msgid "@niko Ah, neither do we!\\>\\n\\@niko But shrews and field mice and stuff do."
msgstr ""
"@niko じゃあ、ミーと一緒だ！\\>\\n\\@niko あ、でもトガリネズミとか野ネズミとか、\n"
"そういう生き物は地中に住んでるよね。"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I see..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed なるほど…"

msgid "@niko_speak Does your world have a sun?"
msgstr "@niko_speak 神様の世界にも太陽はある？"

msgid "[\"Yes, it's also a ball of fire.\", \"I can't tell you that.\"]"
msgstr "[\"ああ。こっちでも火の玉だ。\",\"それは言えない。\"]"

msgid "@niko_speak Really?\\>\\n\\@niko_pancakes Wow!\\>\\n\\@niko Can you hold it?"
msgstr "@niko_speak 本当？\\>\\@niko_pancakes すごい！\\>\\n\\@niko 手で持てる？"

msgid "@niko ..."
msgstr "@niko …"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed ...\\nThat was a silly question, wasn't it..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed …\\nまぬけな質問だったよね…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Oh..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed そう…"

msgid "@niko The sun in my home world is very bright.\\>\\n\\@niko_speak Warm, too!\\>\\n\\@niko You saw, right?"
msgstr "@niko ミーの世界では、太陽がすごく明るいんだ。\\>\\n\\@niko_speak それに暖かい！\\>\\n\\@niko 見たでしょ？"

msgid "@niko But it goes away sometimes, at night.\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed Everything gets dark, kinda like how this world is now."
msgstr "@niko でも時々いなくなっちゃうんだ、夜とかに。\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed 何もかも暗くなる。この世界みたいに。"

msgid "@niko_speak But it's okay because the sun always comes back the next day.\\>\\n\\@niko That's good, don't you think?"
msgstr ""
"@niko_speak でも次の日には\n"
"必ず戻ってくるから大丈夫なんだ。\\>\\n\\@niko すごいでしょ？"

msgid "[\"Yeah.\", \"My world is like that too.\"]"
msgstr "[\"そうだな。\",\"私の世界も同じだ。\"]"

msgid "@niko M-hm!"
msgstr "@niko うん！"

msgid "@niko During the night, people usually go to sleep.\\>\\n\\@niko_speak But some people stay up and use computers!"
msgstr ""
"@niko 夜になるとね、いつもみんなお布団に入るんだ。\\>\\n\\@niko_speak でも時々、\n"
"寝ずにコンピューターをいじってる人もいる！"

msgid "@niko_speak Ah!\\>\\nDo you sleep during the night?"
msgstr "@niko_speak そっか！\\>\\n神様は夜に寝るの？"

msgid "@niko We go to sleep, usually.\\>\\n\\@niko_speak But some people stay up and use computers!"
msgstr ""
"@niko ミーの世界だと、みんなお布団に入るんだ。\\>\\n\\@niko_speak でも時々、\n"
"寝ずにコンピューターをいじってる人もいる！"

msgid "@niko I... don't have to explain what they are, do I?\\>\\n\\@niko_speak There's a bunch of them in this world!"
msgstr ""
"@niko コンピューターは…\n"
"説明しなくても分かるよね？\\>\\n\\@niko_speak この世界にもたくさんあるし！"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed An-anyway, we should probably get going..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed えっ、と、そろそろ先に進もっか…"

msgid "@niko_speak \\p, I had another dream!"
msgstr "@niko_speak \\p、 また夢を見たよ！"

msgid "@niko Did you see this one too?"
msgstr "@niko 今度のも見えた？"

msgid "[\"Yeah\"]"
msgstr "[\"ああ。\"]"

msgid "@niko I was in a big field, like the one in my last dream..."
msgstr "@niko 前の夢みたいな、おっきな野原にいて…"

msgid "@niko_speak And... I saw my village!\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed ...but then I woke up."
msgstr "@niko_speak それから…ミーの村が見えた！\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed …でも、そこで目が覚めちゃった。"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Sigh..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed はぁ…"

msgid "@niko Ah, I don't think this world has anything like that...\\>\\n\\@niko_speak I mean, big wheat fields!"
msgstr "@niko この世界にはあんなものないと思う…\\>\\n\\@niko_speak あ、大きな小麦畑のことね！"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed The only big plants I've seen here are a bunch of weird trees.\\>\\n\\@niko And those balls of moss floating in the water..."
msgstr ""
"@niko_eyeclosed ここで見た大きな植物といえば、\n"
"たくさんある変な木だけ。\\>\\n\\@niko あとは、水に浮かんでる\n"
"コケのカタマリぐらい…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Wait, is moss even a plant...?"
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed あれ、コケってそもそも植物なのかな…？"

msgid "@niko ...\\>\\n\\@niko_speak ...Say, have you seen a wheat field before, \\p?"
msgstr "@niko …\\>\\n\\@niko_speak …ねえ \\p、 小麦畑って見たことある？"

msgid "[\"Yes.\", \"No.\"]"
msgstr "[\"ああ。\",\"いや。\"]"

msgid "@niko_speak Oh!\\>\\n\\@niko They're really pretty, aren't they?"
msgstr "@niko_speak ほんと！\\>\\n\\@niko すっごく綺麗だよね？"

msgid "@niko Ah.... well...\\>\\n\\@niko_speak They're really pretty! \\>\\@niko They look like-"
msgstr "@niko そっか…えっと…\\>\\n\\@niko_speak すごくきれいなんだ！ \\>\\@niko まるで――"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Wait... you just saw one in my dream..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 待って…さっきミーの夢の中で見たでしょ…"

msgid "@niko_speak The one around my village goes around for miles!"
msgstr ""
"@niko_speak ミーの村の周りにあるやつは、何キロも\n"
"先まで広がってるんだ！"

msgid "@niko_speak The plants are really tall, sometimes I can't even see through them!\\>\\n\\@niko When it's windy out, the wind can make waves in it."
msgstr ""
"@niko_speak 小麦の背がすごく高くて、\n"
"たまに周りが全然見渡せなくなる！\\>\\n\\@niko あと風が強い日だとね、波打って見えるんだ。"

msgid "@niko It's like an ocean...\\>\\n\\@niko_speak ...of food!"
msgstr "@niko まるで海…\\>\\n\\@niko_speak …食べ物の海みたいにね！"

msgid "@niko Oh, wait, but there's food in regular oceans too...\\>\\n\\@niko Like fish, \\@niko_speak or crabs!"
msgstr "@niko あ、でも、普通の海にも食べ物はあるよ…\\>\\n\\@niko お魚とか、\\@niko_speak カニとか！"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I've never actually been to a real ocean until now, actually..."
msgstr ""
"@niko_eyeclosed 実はね、本物の海をまだ見たことが\n"
"ないんだ…"

msgid "[\"Me neither.\", \"I've been to the ocean.\"]"
msgstr "[\"私もだ。\",\"海なら見たことがある。\"]"

msgid "@niko_speak Oh!\\>\\n\\@niko I guess we have that in common, \\p!"
msgstr "@niko_speak おお！\\>\\n\\@niko じゃあミーと一緒だね、 \\p！"

msgid "@niko But you're kind of seeing the ocean now? In this world, anyway."
msgstr ""
"@niko でも今はある意味、海を見てるよね？\n"
"まあ、この世界のだけど。"

msgid "@niko_speak As for me, I've seen them on TV before!"
msgstr "@niko_speak ミーは、前にテレビで見たことがある！"

msgid "@niko That's really cool, \\p!\\>\\n\\@niko I've only seen the ocean on TV before."
msgstr "@niko すごいね、 \\p！\\>\\n\\@niko ミーはテレビでしか見たことないや。"

msgid "@niko_pancakes I never thought I'd get to ride a boat through one!\\>\\n\\@niko The water back home doesn't have glowy stuff like how it is here, either!"
msgstr ""
"@niko_pancakes まさか船にまで乗れるなんて！\\>\\n\\@niko それに故郷の水は、ここと違って\n"
"中で何もキラキラ光ってなかったよ！"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Ah... but I guess it's because the world is already so dark..."
msgstr ""
"@niko_eyeclosed あっ…もしかしたら、この世界がかなり\n"
"暗いせいかもしれないね…"

msgid "@niko ...Y'know, I used to be scared of the dark,\\n\\p!\\> \\@niko_eyeclosed It's a little hard to imagine that now, after spending so much time here..."
msgstr ""
"@niko …あのね \\p、 \n"
"ミー、昔は暗いところが怖かったんだ！ \\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed ここにずっといると、それが嘘みたいだけど…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed But not long ago, I couldn't even go to sleep without a lamp..."
msgstr ""
"@niko_eyeclosed でも少し前まで、ランプがないと\n"
"全然寝られなかった…"

msgid "[\"Me too.\", \"It's good you got over that.\"]"
msgstr "[\"私もだ。\",\"克服できて良かったな。\"]"

msgid "@niko_speak Really?\\>\\n\\@niko Even though you're a god?"
msgstr "@niko_speak 本当？\\>\\n\\@niko 神様なのに？"

msgid "@niko_speak Oh, but it's a good thing I got over that fear!\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed Otherwise I wouldn't last long here..."
msgstr "@niko_speak あっ、でも克服できて良かったよ！\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed じゃないとこの世界では大変…"

msgid "@niko_83c I guess!\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed Otherwise I wouldn't last long here..."
msgstr "@niko_83c そうだね！\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed じゃないとここでは大変…"

msgid "@niko_speak Then again, I've been carrying around the sun, so it's not too bad!"
msgstr ""
"@niko_speak と思ったけど、太陽を持ち歩いてるから\n"
"そこまで悪くなさそうだね！"

msgid "@niko And also, I don't feel scared at all with you guiding me!\\>\\n\\@niko_83c So... thanks for that!"
msgstr ""
"@niko それに、神様がミーを導いてくれるから、\n"
"全然怖くないんだ！\\>\\n\\@niko_83c だから…ありがとう！"

msgid "@niko_speak Anyway, maybe we should head out now, \\p..."
msgstr ""
"@niko_speak よし、そろそろ進んだほうが\n"
"いいよね、 \\p…"

msgid "@niko \\p?\\>\\n\\@niko I had another dream..."
msgstr "@niko \\p？\\>\\n\\@niko また夢を見た…"

msgid "@niko Mama was there.\\>\\n\\@niko_speak Did you see her?"
msgstr "@niko ママがいたよ。\\>\\n\\@niko_speak 見えた？"

msgid "@niko_pancakes She made me pancakes!\\>\\n\\@niko I... think it was my birthday."
msgstr "@niko_pancakes パンケーキ作ってくれた！\\>\\n\\@niko たぶん…ミーの誕生日だった。"

msgid "@niko_speak Cuz people always get their favorite food on their birthday!\\>\\nA whole lot of it!"
msgstr ""
"@niko_speak だって誕生日には、みんな\n"
"一番好きな食べ物がもらえるでしょ！\\>\\nしかもたくさん！"

msgid "@niko Do you have a birthday, too?"
msgstr "@niko 神様にも誕生日はあるの？"

msgid "@niko_speak Oh!\\>\\n\\@niko Then... what's your favorite food?\\>\\n\\@niko_pancakes Is it pancakes?"
msgstr "@niko_speak ほんと！\\>\\n\\@niko じゃあ…一番好きな食べ物は何？\\>\\n\\@niko_pancakes もしかしてパンケーキ？"

msgid "@niko Wait, DO you like pancakes?"
msgstr "@niko あっ、そもそもパンケーキは好き？"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I see...\\>\\n\\@niko_speak Makes sense, since you're a god!"
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed そっか…\\>\\n\\@niko_speak そうだよね、神様だもんね！"

msgid "@niko So...\\. do you like pancakes too?"
msgstr "@niko じゃあ…\\. 神様も、パンケーキ好き？"

msgid "@niko_speak Me too!\\>\\n\\@niko On my last birthday, I ate ten of them.\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed I was so full I didn't eat anything else that day..."
msgstr ""
"@niko_speak ミーも！\\>\\n\\@niko 去年の誕生日なんて、10個も食べちゃった。\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed お腹がいっぱいになりすぎて、\n"
"その日は他に何も食べられなかった…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Ah...\\>\\n\\@niko_speak Well, they're tasty!\\>\\n\\@niko Maybe you should give them a chance, y'know?"
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed そうなんだ…\\>\\n\\@niko_speak でも、ほんとは美味しいよ！\\>\\n\\@niko もう一度食べてみなよ、ね？"

msgid "@niko_speak My mama makes the best pancakes!\\>\\n\\@niko And some of the neighbors make really good noodles."
msgstr ""
"@niko_speak ママが作るパンケーキは最高だよ！\\>\\n\\@niko すごく美味しい麺料理を作る\n"
"ご近所さんもいるんだ。"

msgid "@niko_speak And oh! One of our neighbors make a lot of bread.\\>\\n\\@niko Do you have any neighbors?"
msgstr ""
"@niko_speak あ、それに！パンをたくさん作る\n"
"ご近所さんも。\\>\\n\\@niko 神様にはご近所さん、いる？"

msgid "@niko_speak Oh! Do they share their food with you?"
msgstr "@niko_speak おぉ！その人たちは食べ物を分けてくれる？"

msgid "@niko Ours do too!"
msgstr "@niko ミーのところと一緒だ！"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed That's not very nice of them..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed あまり優しくないね…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Oh...\\>\\n\\@niko That sounds a bit lonely."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed そっか…\\>\\n\\@niko ちょっと寂しいね。"

msgid "@niko Our neighbors and my mama take turns making food for the whole village each day.\\>\\n\\@niko_speak Everyone also takes turns doing chores and watching the little kids!"
msgstr ""
"@niko ご近所さんとママで交代しながら\n"
"毎日、村にいる人全員の食べ物を作ってるんだ。\\>\\n\\@niko_speak 他のみんなで交代して、雑用とか\n"
"小さい子のお世話もしてるよ！"

msgid "@niko I don't need to be watched anymore, though. \\>\\n\\@niko_speak I'm old enough to help out!"
msgstr ""
"@niko ミーはもうお世話してもらわなくても\n"
"大丈夫だけどね。 \\>\\n\\@niko_speak 大人になったから、みんなの役に立てる！"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed ...\\>\\n\\@niko I miss everyone."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed …\\>\\n\\@niko みんなに会いたいな。"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I've been gone for a while now, haven't I?\\>\\n\\@niko_speak I wonder if they're worried about me..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 最後に会ったの、いつだろ？\\>\\n\\@niko_speak 心配してるかな…"

msgid "@niko Ah, speaking of helping out, we should probably go now."
msgstr ""
"@niko あっ、役に立てるといえば、\n"
"もうそろそろ行かなくちゃ。"

msgid "@niko Hey.... \\p?"
msgstr "@niko ねえ…… \\p？"

msgid "@niko I guess... you saw my dream?"
msgstr "@niko ミーの夢…見てたよね？"

msgid "@niko_distressed It was..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed あれって…"

msgid "@niko_distressed2 .\\..\\..\\..\\.."
msgstr "@niko_distressed2 .\\..\\..\\..\\.."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Come on, let's go..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed なんでもない。もう行こう…"

msgid "[\"Niko.\"]"
msgstr "[\"ニコ。\"]"

msgid "@niko ...Hello?\\> \\@niko_speak ...\\p?"
msgstr "@niko …誰？\\>\\@niko_speak …\\p？"

msgid "@niko_speak Was that you just now?"
msgstr "@niko_speak 今の、神様なの？"

msgid "@niko_speak I thought I... heard your voice?\\>\\n\\@niko ...in my dream..."
msgstr "@niko_speak 神様の声が…聞こえた気がしたんだけど。\\>\\n\\@niko …夢の中で…"

msgid "@niko ...\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed ...Ah, guess you're still not there..."
msgstr "@niko …\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed …そっか、まだいないんだね…"

msgid "@niko_distressed ..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed …"

msgid "@niko_speak Wait... there's something in my pocket. \\>\\n\\@niko I don't remember putting it there..."
msgstr "@niko_speak あれ…ポケットに何かある。 \\>\\n\\@niko こんなとこに何か入れたっけ…"

msgid "@ed [Niko feels uneasy.]"
msgstr "@ed [ニコは不安げな様子だ。]"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed ..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed …"

msgid "@niko_speak ....\\p?"
msgstr "@niko_speak …\\p？"

msgid "@niko_surprised ......\\p!!! Can you hear me?"
msgstr "@niko_surprised ……\\p！！ 聞こえる？"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Oh, phew..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed はあ、よかった…"

msgid "@niko_speak What happened?"
msgstr "@niko_speak 何が起きたの？"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Everything went pitch black for a second..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 一瞬、何もかも真っ暗になった…"

msgid "@niko_speak \\p?"
msgstr "@niko_speak \\p？"

msgid "@niko_surprised Are you still there?"
msgstr "@niko_surprised まだそこにいる？"

msgid "[\"I'm here.\"]"
msgstr "[\"いるよ。\"]"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed It happened again..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed まただよ…"

msgid "@niko_what Everything just went really dark..."
msgstr "@niko_what 何もかも、全部暗くなっちゃった…"

msgid "@niko_speak So dark, the lightbulb doesn't even light it!"
msgstr "@niko_speak 暗すぎて、電球も役に立たなかった！"

msgid "@niko2 Oh, and it's not because I don't have the lightbulb anymore, either!"
msgstr "@niko2 あ、電球を失くしたからじゃないよ！"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed It feels like a different kind of dark..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 違う感じの暗さみたいだよ…"

msgid "@niko_distressed Oh...."
msgstr "@niko_distressed はあ…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed \\p, let me know when you're back..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed \\p、 戻ってきたら教えてね…"

msgid "[\"I'm back\"]"
msgstr "[\"戻ったよ。\"]"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I don't know why this keeps happening..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed どうしてこんなことが起きるんだろう…"

msgid "@niko_speak I don't think anyone else is noticing it, either..."
msgstr "@niko_speak みんな気づいてないのかな…"

msgid "@niko_what Am I the only one who's seeing this?"
msgstr "@niko_what これを見てるのは、ミーだけ？"

msgid "[\"Niko, I'm back\"]"
msgstr "[\"ニコ、戻ったよ。\"]"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Hey, \\p..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed やあ、 \\p…"

msgid "@niko Welcome back."
msgstr "@niko おかえりなさい。"

msgid "[\"FLAG MANAGER\", \"VAR MANAGER\", \"EXIT\"]"
msgstr ""

msgid "[EVENING NEWS! EVENING NEWS!]"
msgstr "[夕刊でス！夕刊でス！]"

msgid "[I AM NOT CERTAIN THAT IT IS EVENING.]"
msgstr "[夕方かどうかハ定かデハありませン。]"

msgid "[BUT MY LIGHT SENSORS ARE NOT DETECTING DAYLIGHT.]"
msgstr "[デスガ、光センサーハ日光を検知していませン。]"

msgid "[I WILL ASSUME IT IS EVENING.]"
msgstr "[ワタシハ現在を夕方と仮定しまス。]"

msgid "[MAINTENANCE IS STRUGGLING TO FIX THE MAJOR PIPELINE COLLAPSE IN THE NORTH SECTOR.]"
msgstr ""
"[メンテナンスハ、北区域で起きた\n"
"主要パイプライン崩落の修復に\n"
"手間取っていまス。]"

msgid "[LIKELIHOOD OF AN IMMINENT WATER SHORTAGE IN THE INNER CITY IS NOW 84.2%]"
msgstr ""
"[都市部デ水不足ガ発生する\n"
"確率ハ84.2%となりましタ。]"

msgid "[DISTURBANCE WAS DETECTED FROM THE GROUND ACCESS ELEVATOR ON MAIN STREET.]"
msgstr ""
"[大通りニある、地上アクセスエレベーターから\n"
"異常ガ検知されましタ。]"

msgid "[HOWEVER, THE ISSUE QUICKLY RESOLVED ITSELF BEFORE INVESTIGATIONS COULD TAKE PLACE.]"
msgstr ""
"[デスガ、調査ガ行われる前に\n"
"その問題ハ迅速に対処されましタ。]"

msgid "[THE MESSIAH IS CURRENTLY SPEAKING TO NEWSBOT UNIT #28.]"
msgstr ""
"[救世主ガ現在、ニュースボット\n"
"ユニット#28と話していまス。]"

msgid "[WHICH IS ME.]"
msgstr "[ワタシのことでス。]"

msgid "[HELLO, MESSIAH.]"
msgstr "[どうモ、救世主。]"

msgid "@niko_speak Hi!"
msgstr "@niko_speak こんばんは！"

msgid "[STRANGE SOUNDS HAVE BEEN REPORTED FROM THE SLUMS.]"
msgstr "[スラム街カラ、奇妙な音ガすると報告ガありましタ。]"

msgid "[THEIR SOURCE IS UNKNOWN.]"
msgstr "[発生源ハ未だ不明でス。]"

msgid "[THESE SOUNDS HAVE BEEN DESCRIBED AS \"FAINT BLEATING\" BY THE AREA'S RESIDENTS.]"
msgstr ""
"[地域住民ハ、この音を\n"
"「かすかな鳴き声」と呼んでいまス。]"

msgid "[EVENING NEWS COMMUNITY BULLETIN]"
msgstr "[夕方ニュース地域掲示板]"

msgid "[THE LIBRARY RELEASED SEVERAL NEW BOOKS BY THE ELUSIVE AUTHOR LAST WEEK.]"
msgstr ""
"[図書館ガ先週、姿なき「作者」の新作を\n"
"いくつか発表しましタ。]"

msgid "[THE HEAD LIBRARIAN RECOMMENDS THEM.]"
msgstr "[図書館長ノ推薦本となっていまス。]"

msgid "[THE ASSISTANT LIBRARIAN HAD NO COMMENT AS HE REPORTEDLY FLED THE SCENE SOBBING.]"
msgstr ""
"[司書補ハ報道によると、現場から泣きながら\n"
"逃走したため、ノーコメント。]"

msgid "[THE RECEPTIONIST HAD NO COMMENT EITHER BECAUSE THE RECEPTIONIST IS A ROBOT.]"
msgstr ""
"[受付モロボットであるため、\n"
"ノーコメントでしタ。]"

msgid "$Greetings, \\p.\\nIf you can finally read this, that means you are near the Tower."
msgstr ""
"$やあ、\n"
"\\p。\\nこれを読んでいると\n"
"いうことは、君は\n"
"塔の近くにいると\n"
"いうことだね。"

msgid "$The Tower is the domain of an elusive Entity."
msgstr ""
"$塔は、捉えどころのない\n"
"「存在」の領域だ。"

msgid "$This being is connected to the world.\\nFor now, you can think of it as the spirit of the world."
msgstr ""
"$この「存在」は、この\n"
"世界と繋がっている。\\nとりあえずは、世界の\n"
"魂として考えてもらって\n"
"かまわない。"

msgid "$It has no physical form, but it can communicate through computers and other machinery."
msgstr ""
"$その魂に物理的な\n"
"形態はないが、\n"
"コンピューターや\n"
"他の機械を通じて\n"
"コミュニケーションを\n"
"取ることができる。"

msgid "$...You know who I am talking about, of course."
msgstr ""
"$…誰のことを言っている\n"
"のか、分かっているね。"

msgid "$When you first arrived here with our savior, it no doubt contacted you right away."
msgstr ""
"$君が救世主とともに\n"
"ここに来た時、ヤツは\n"
"すぐに君に接触して\n"
"きたはずだ。"

msgid "$Through its own means, the entity will guide the both of you to the Tower."
msgstr ""
"$独自の方法で、\n"
"「存在」は君たちを\n"
"塔に導く。"

msgid "$The entry room is at the Tower's base.\\nNot only do you need the sun there, but also three pieces of the previous sun."
msgstr ""
"$入り口は\n"
"塔の基部にある。\\nそして太陽だけでなく、\n"
"以前まであった太陽の\n"
"3つのかけらも\n"
"必要になる。"

msgid "$The savior will not be able to do anything there.\\nYou, \\p, on the other hand..."
msgstr ""
"$そこでは、救世主は\n"
"何もできない。\\nだがその一方で、\n"
"\\p、 君は…"

msgid "$Look at the pattern on the floor. Do as it says.\\nThe window will be gone, so you need to bring it back."
msgstr ""
"$床の模様を見るんだ。\n"
"そして、ただそれに\n"
"従えばいい。\\n「窓」が消えるだろう\n"
"が、元に戻せばよい。"

msgid "@niko I'm not sure where I am, exactly..."
msgstr "@niko ここがどこなのか、全然わかんないや…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I can't see too far off, everything's so dark..."
msgstr ""
"@niko_eyeclosed どこもすごく暗くて、\n"
"あんまり遠くまで見えない…"

msgid "@prophet [Our World Was Not Always This Dim.]"
msgstr ""
"@prophet [ワタクシたちの世界は、いつもこれほど\n"
"暗かったわけではございません。]"

msgid "@prophet [Nor Was It So Broken.]"
msgstr "@prophet [これほど壊れていたわけでもございません。]"

msgid "@prophet_hmm [But Time Waits For Nobody, Not Even Saviors.]"
msgstr ""
"@prophet_hmm [しかし時間は待ってくれません、\n"
"たとえ救世主であっても。]"

msgid "@prophet [The World Is Divided Into Three Regions.]"
msgstr "@prophet [この世界は、3つの地域に分かれております。]"

msgid "@prophet [You're On The Fringe Right Now, The Barrens.]"
msgstr ""
"@prophet [今、アナタサマはその外れ…\n"
"『不毛の地』という場所におられます。]"

msgid "@prophet [That Tower You See In The Distance Once Held Our Sun.]"
msgstr ""
"@prophet [遠くに見えるあの塔には、\n"
"かつて太陽が置かれておりました。]"

msgid "@niko_speak Oh, so that's what the tall thing was..."
msgstr "@niko_speak あっ、あの高いのは塔だったんだ…"

msgid "@prophet [As You Go Further Towards The Center, You Will Cross The Other Regions.]"
msgstr ""
"@prophet [中心に近づくにつれて、\n"
"他の地域を横断することになります。]"

msgid "@prophet_hmm [There Should Be A Map Still In This Outpost Somewhere...]"
msgstr ""
"@prophet_hmm [この前哨基地のどこかに、\n"
"地図がまだあるはずです…]"

msgid "@niko_speak Ooo..."
msgstr "@niko_speak そうなんだ…"

msgid "@niko I found it in the house I woke up in..."
msgstr ""
"@niko ミーが起きた家で、\n"
"これを見つけたんだ…"

msgid "@prophet [Within Your Hands Is Our New Sun.]"
msgstr ""
"@prophet [アナタサマが手に持っておられるのが、\n"
"ワタクシたちの新しい太陽でございます。]"

msgid "@niko Your... \\.\\.\\@niko_speak sun?"
msgstr "@niko 君たちの… \\.\\.\\@niko_speak 太陽？"

msgid "@prophet_omg [Yes!]"
msgstr "@prophet_omg [その通りです！]"

msgid "@prophet [Years Ago,\\.\\. Our Previous Sun Sat Atop That Tower And Spilled Its Life Into The Land.]"
msgstr ""
"@prophet [数年ほど前、\\.\\. 塔の頂上に鎮座していた以前の太陽は、\n"
"その生命を、大地に注いでくれていました。]"

msgid "@prophet_sigh [But One Day, The Light Went Out.]"
msgstr "@prophet_sigh [しかしある日、光が消えてしまったのです。]"

msgid "@prophet_sigh [The World Is Still Hanging On By A Thread.]"
msgstr "@prophet_sigh [この世界は、まだ危険に晒されております。]"

msgid "@prophet_hmm [The Surface Of This World Is Abundant With An Element Called Phosphor.]"
msgstr ""
"@prophet_hmm [この世界の地表には、\n"
"蛍光体と呼ばれる物質が豊富に存在しております。]"

msgid "@prophet_hmm [Fortunately For Us, This Element Stored Light Energy From Our Previous Sun.]"
msgstr ""
"@prophet_hmm [幸いなことに、この物質には以前の\n"
"太陽光エネルギーが蓄えられておりました。]"

msgid "@prophet_hmm [It's Now Our Only Source Of Illumination, But Its Energy Is Finite.]"
msgstr ""
"@prophet_hmm [現在、それが唯一の光源となっております。\n"
"しかしそのエネルギーには限りがあるのです。]"

msgid "@prophet_sigh [When The Last Of The Light Dies,\\.\\. Our World Will Too.]"
msgstr "@prophet_sigh [最後の光が消滅すると、\\.\\. ワタクシたちの世界も…]"

msgid "@niko_speak ...\\.\\.\\@niko_eyeclosed Ah..."
msgstr "@niko_speak …\\.\\.\\@niko_eyeclosed そう…"

msgid "@prophet [But Now That You Are Here With The New Sun, All Is Well.]"
msgstr ""
"@prophet [しかし、アナタサマが新たな太陽を持って\n"
"こられたので、もう安心でございましょう。]"

msgid "@prophet [You Will Need To Restore It To The Tower.]"
msgstr "@prophet [その太陽を、塔にお戻しください。]"

msgid "@niko2 That looks... pretty far off!"
msgstr "@niko2 けっこう…遠そうだね！"

msgid "@prophet [Yes. So Begins Your Pilgrimage.]"
msgstr "@prophet [はい。旅の始まりでございます。]"

msgid "@prophet_hmm [Also, The Sun Is Fragile, So Be Careful.]"
msgstr ""
"@prophet_hmm [あと、太陽は壊れやすいですから、\n"
"どうかお気をつけて。]"

msgid "@prophet_sigh [If The Sun Shatters, The World Will End In An Instant.]"
msgstr ""
"@prophet_sigh [太陽が砕けると、世界は一瞬で\n"
"滅びてしまいます。]"

msgid "@niko3 Oh..."
msgstr "@niko3 え…"

msgid "@niko Oh..."
msgstr "@niko えっと…"

msgid "@niko I don't mean to be rude, but I..."
msgstr "@niko こんなこと言いたくないんだけど、でも…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I'm... not sure about this."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed ちょっと…自信ないかも。"

msgid "@niko_distressed2 I still don't know how I got here!"
msgstr ""
"@niko_distressed2 どうやってここに来たのかも\n"
"まだ分かってないし！"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I was just with my mama a few hours ago..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed ちょっと前までは、ママと一緒にいたのに…"

msgid "@niko_distressed2 And now it feels like I'm in a bad dream..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed2 今はまるで、悪夢の中にいるみたい…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I just want to go home..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed ミーは早く家に帰りたいだけなんだ…"

msgid "@prophet [...]"
msgstr "@prophet […]"

msgid "@prophet [Your Mission Is To Save Our World.]"
msgstr "@prophet [アナタサマの使命は、この世界を救うこと。]"

msgid "@prophet_hmm [Just As My Mission Is To Tell You About Our World.]"
msgstr ""
"@prophet_hmm [この世界に関する情報を提供することが、\n"
"ワタクシの使命であるのと同じように。]"

msgid "@prophet [I Am Unable To Help You Beyond My Programming.]"
msgstr ""
"@prophet [プログラムされていないことは\n"
"何もお手伝いできません。]"

msgid "@prophet_sigh [I Am Sorry.]"
msgstr "@prophet_sigh [申し訳ございません。]"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed ...oh."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed …そっか。"

msgid "@niko_shock \\|...\\.\\...."
msgstr "@niko_shock \\|…\\.\\.…"

msgid "@niko_speak \\p! Did you see what happened?"
msgstr "@niko_speak \\p！ 今の見た？"

msgid "[\"Yeah?\"]"
msgstr "[\"ああ。\"]"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed My vision went blank for a second...\\>\\n\\@niko_speak And then I saw something?"
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 目の前が一瞬、真っ暗になって…\\>\\n\\@niko_speak それで、何かが見えたような…？"

msgid "@niko Like a really short dream..."
msgstr "@niko すごく短い夢、みたいな…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I wonder what that was about..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 何だったんだろう…"

msgid "So you actually made it here."
msgstr "ここまで来たか。"

msgid "I... guess you win, \\p."
msgstr "ふむ…おまえの勝ちのようだな、 \\p。"

msgid "I'll tell you how to save the world, then."
msgstr "ならば、世界を救う方法を教えよう。"

msgid "When you reach the summit, shatter the lightbulb, and..."
msgstr "頂上に辿り着いた後、電球を砕き、そして…"

msgid "...I'm just humoring you."
msgstr "…ただの冗談だ。"

msgid "I know you've been getting help from a certain someone."
msgstr "おまえが、どこぞの誰かから助けを得ているのは知っている。"

msgid "He already told you about the choice, didn't he?"
msgstr "すでにそいつから、「選択」のことは聞いたのだろう？"

msgid "Are you still planning to save the world, \\p?"
msgstr "おまえはまだ世界を救うつもりなのか、 \\p？"

msgid "Why are you trying so hard for this?"
msgstr "なぜそれほど躍起になっている？"

msgid "Haven't you even figured out what this world IS?"
msgstr "この世界がどういうものなのかさえ、解っていないのだろう？"

msgid "I told you at the beginning, your mission is to help Niko leave."
msgstr "最初に伝えたように、君の使命はニコが帰れるように手助けしてあげることだ。"

msgid "Because Niko isn't part of this world."
msgstr "何故なら、ニコはこの世界の一員ではないからな。"

msgid "Niko is the only thing worth saving here."
msgstr "この場所で救う価値があるのは、ニコだけなのだ。"

msgid "..."
msgstr "…"

msgid "...The final choice is up to you."
msgstr "…最後にどうするかは、おまえ次第だ。"

msgid "I can't go against my programming."
msgstr "私は、自身のプログラムに逆らうことができない。"

msgid "You only have one shot, \\p."
msgstr "チャンスは一度きりだ、 \\p。"

msgid "If you choose to smash the lightbulb, then Niko wakes up back home, like it was all a dream."
msgstr "もし電球を砕けば、ニコは故郷の家で目覚める。すべてが夢であったかのように。"

msgid "But if you let Niko return the sun, the child will have to bear the weight of this sacrifice."
msgstr "しかし、もし太陽を元の場所に戻すと、あの子はその犠牲の重荷を背負わなければならなくなる。"

msgid "At least, tell Niko the truth."
msgstr "いずれにせよ、ニコには真実を伝えるべきだ。"

msgid "...you do care about Niko, don't you?"
msgstr "…ニコのことを大切にしているのだろう？"

msgid "@niko2 Oh... I found this page."
msgstr "@niko2 あっ…こんなページがあったよ。"

msgid "@niko It looks kind of like a drawing of this room."
msgstr "@niko この部屋の絵みたいだね。"

msgid "@niko_speak Maybe it's telling us we should come here?"
msgstr "@niko_speak たぶん、この部屋に行けってことかな？"

msgid "@niko Which we did, already."
msgstr "@niko もう来ちゃったけどね。"

msgid "@niko_speak So... it looks like we're on the right track!"
msgstr ""
"@niko_speak ということは…ミーたち、ちゃんと\n"
"前に進めてるんだね！"

msgid "@alula I'm helping!"
msgstr "@alula 手伝うー！"

msgid "@silver [Hello again.]"
msgstr "@silver [どうしたの。]"

msgid "@Niko Hello."
msgstr "@Niko こんばんは。"

msgid "@silver2 [Do you... need anything?]"
msgstr "@silver2 [何か…必要？]"

msgid "@Niko Nah."
msgstr "@Niko ううん。"

msgid "@silver [Okay.]"
msgstr "@silver [そう。]"

